  SYMMETRIC on every row of all three blocks means the no-go covers any
  ancilla count, any coupling with a spectrally symmetric generator, and
  every cycle of a repeated run - a statement about a CLASS rather than
  about one protocol. Any 'asym' row narrows it, and the scope sentence in
  the manuscript then has to name the restriction that is doing the work.
